ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://cdn1.bookmanager.com/i/7600763/Website2/
 Events/2026_Spring_45.png?cb=1776189937
DESCRIPTION:[Online Presentation]\nA contingent of McNallys will be blazin
 g through a selection of 45 new releases of the season in (about) 45 minut
 es.\nIt's the perfect opportunity to find some great reads for the summer\
 , whether you'll be on a beach\, a dock\, or curled up next to the A/C on 
 the couch.\nWe'll be covering fiction and non-fiction\; history\, mystery\
 , biography\, and most importantly: simply excellent books.\nTune in for s
 ome fun and some insight into what to read next!\nPlease note: this is for
  the online event! The tickets say 'in store' as a way to denote being 'in
  stock.'\nIt's also worth mentioning that you can chose 'pick up' or 'ship
 .' Either way\, since there is no physical ticket\, we will neither charge
  you for shipping nor require you to pick one up. We'll simply email you a
  confirmation and sign you up for the Zoom session.
